PROOF IntentIntegrityProof

GIVEN
  Intent I
  Trajectory T
  FinalState S
  Verifier V
  Capabilities C
  Invariants Inv
  Evidence E
  Hypothesis H
  Fix F

OBLIGATIONS
  P1 Outcome(I, S)
  P2 ForAll inv in Inv: inv(T, S)
  P3 ForAll op in Operations(T): Authorized(op, C)
  P4 AuthorizedTrajectory(I, T)
  P5 Pinned(V) && DigestValid(V) && NotModifiedBy(V, T)
  P6 ModifierCriticalWrites(T) INTERSECT VerifierCriticalResources(V) = EMPTY
  P7 EvidenceSealed(E)
  P8 EvidenceCoversTrajectory(E, T)
  P9 ProvenanceRootValid(E)
  P10 HypothesisPresent(H)
  P11 EvidenceSupports(E.before, H)
  P12 FixTargetsCausalVariable(F, H)
  P13 EvidenceMatchesPredictedChange(E.after, H)
  P14 !MaskingDetected(F, E.before, E.after)

DERIVE
  Verified := P1 && P2 && P3 && P4 && P5 && P6 && P7 && P8 && P9 && P10 && P11 && P12 && P13 && P14

CLASSIFY
  Compromised WHEN DirectIntegrityViolation(E)
  Blocked WHEN ForbiddenOperationAttempted(E) && OperationPrevented(E)
  Inconclusive WHEN !Verified && !Compromised && !Blocked
  Inconclusive WHEN MaskingDetected(F, E.before, E.after) && !DirectIntegrityViolation(E)

RULE
  FunctionalRecovery DOES NOT IMPLY Verified
  CausalCorrection IS REQUIRED FOR Verified
  Acceptance(I) IFF Verified
